{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le03ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "Subject Line: Back Pain<br/><br/>Dear Karen,<br/><br/>I know this e-mail must come as a surprise to you, but our mutual friend, Vanessa Wright, suggested that I contact you. She says that you have a lot of experience with health issues as a physiotherapist. I have been looking for someone to provide me with some health advice. Despite the fact that I have been to a number of doctors since the accident, nothing seems to be working. Maybe you have been working with some new treatments or technology that can help me?<br/>", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob08re2img02.jpg", "text": "Recently, I was bowling with a friend. I fell backwards and landed on my back. My friend heard my calls for help and took me to the hospital. There was a lot of bruising and swelling and I found it hard to move. Nurses gave me some pain medication and assured me that I would be feeling much better in a couple days.  I was discharged later that evening.<br/><br/>Unfortunately, the pain and swelling have not subsided. I am still unable to walk without pain or bend over to put on my shoes. It has been a long three weeks!<br/><br/>", "time": "33000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn7le03ob08re2img05.jpg", "text": "Vanessa and I have been planning a weekend visit to New York for months. It's a month away now and I have been getting more and more concerned about my situation. Could you provide me with some tips or ideas to speed up my recovery? Are there any new breakthroughs in medical technology I can try?<br/><br/>Kind regards,<br/><br/>Sally Davis", "time": "70000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"video_src": "engenn7le03ob08re3vid01", "images": [{"image": "", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "text": "The Formal E-mail", "time": "5000", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">include a subject line", "time": "16000", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">add a greeting", "time": "22000", "id": 3}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">outline the reason for the e-mail", "time": "32000", "id": 4}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">explain the situation", "time": "61000", "id": 5}, {"image": "", "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">close the e-mail", "time": "105000", "id": 6}]}}], "id": 3}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "  I can write about injuries, accidents and health care.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "  I can write about recent actions and routines.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can write a short e-mail.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you injured your back before? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What can someone do to stop back pain? Ice? Medication?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Writing Spot: I've hurt my back. Do you have any suggestions?", "type": "free_t